# Mintlify MDX HTML

Mintlify compiles Markdown/MDX to JSX. When adding raw HTML in hand-edited pages:

- Use `className`, never `class`
- Do not use `<strong>` for styled/emphasized spans — Mintlify can fail to render it (`<strong /> could not be rendered`)
- Prefer `<span>` (style via `custom.css`) or Markdown `**bold**`
- Keep `id` hooks for scripts (e.g. `stats-widget.js`) on `<span>`, not `<strong>`

Reference: homepage stat strip in `index.md`.
